The Aquemi wordmark, traced from the master artwork. The SVGs are single-ink and an `<img>` cannot recolour them, so pick the file by its background.

| File | Ink | Use on |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `aquemi-logo-navy.svg` | `navy` #0F2A47 | `surface`, `surface-raised`, `limestone`, white paper |
| `aquemi-logo-limestone.svg` | `limestone` #EBDFD6 | `navy` bands, the footer, dark mode |
| `aquemi-logo-white.svg` | #FFFFFF | Dark, even photography only |
| `aquemi-logo-navy.png` | `navy` #0F2A47, transparent, 3000 × 787 | Office documents and tools that can't use SVG |

Clear space equals the height of the *a*. Minimum width is 96 px on screen and 25 mm in print.
